<!--
Purpose: Assembles the criterion, criteria text, implementing files, and verdict request for an evidence judge.
Used by: bootstrap/src/verify/judge.rs.
This is a fragment bundle: marker names are selected by code, not a sequence of instructions.
-->
<!-- Context: input fragment. Values supplied by the consumer: criterion, criteria, context, files, ask. -->
<!-- input -->
{{{criterion}}}{{{criteria}}}

Context:
{{{context}}}

Implementing files:{{{files}}}

{{{ask}}}

<!-- Context: criterion fragment. Values supplied by the consumer: statement. -->
<!-- criterion -->
Criterion: {{{statement}}}

<!-- Context: file fragment. Values supplied by the consumer: path, text. -->
<!-- file -->
=== {{{path}}} ===
{{{text}}}

<!-- Context: ask criterion fragment. This fragment is static; the consumer selects it by name. -->
<!-- ask-criterion -->
Judge this criterion only. Reply with PASS or FAIL, then your observed evidence.

<!-- Context: ask test fragment. Values supplied by the consumer: test. -->
<!-- ask-test -->
Judge only {{{test}}}. Reply PASS or FAIL with observed evidence.

<!-- Context: ask row fragment. This fragment is static; the consumer selects it by name. -->
<!-- ask-row -->
Reply with a verdict line `PASS` or `FAIL`, then your reasoning.
